xt":"いもむしになりたいのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まであたしのポジションは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと誰かの後ろでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこに居れるだけでもありがたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思えという人もいるかも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しれませんが、あたしはこれでは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"満足出来ません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目の前に誰も居ないポジションで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってみたいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たくなくてもあたしに目が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっちゃうダンスがしたいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからこの機会にいもむしになって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰も前にいないポジションで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊りたいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがあたしのいもむしに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こだわる理由です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたん諦めないぞ( •ㅈ• )ぐふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/07/2906789/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"